on_stop\" default=\"true\">\n+\t\t\tIf [code]true[/code], the animation track cache is cleared when the animation is stopped or the playback queue becomes empty. If [code]false[/code], the track cache is preserved, which can improve performance when animations are frequently started and stopped with the same tracks.","path":"doc/classes/AnimationPlayer.xml","commit_id":"03080707693c6371cd6bee24e5d8a43926f93a53","original_commit_id":"03080707693c6371cd6bee24e5d8a43926f93a53","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"```suggestion\n\t\t\tIf [code]true[/code], the animation track cache is cleared when the animation is stopped or the playback queue becomes empty. If [code]false[/code], the track cache is preserved, which can improve performance when animations are frequently started and stopped.\n```\nIt doesn't matter whether they're the same track. Currently, the cache is updated whenever the animation list changes, so if you were to write it, it would be “same animation list”.","created_at":"2026-06-06T20:05:22Z","updated_at":"2026-06-06T20:0